<title>UK: TELKOM AT $29.5 IN LONDON AT 0829 GMT.</title>
<headline>TELKOM AT $29.5 IN LONDON AT 0829 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telkom traded at $29.5 and London at 0829 GMT on Friday. It recorded the day's low of $29.475 and the day's high of $29.75.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Thursday $29.225. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
